# Local-only brand and merchandise working folder.
# 100 concept files, three planning docs and a generated reading page. Kept out
# of git deliberately: this repo is served publicly by GitHub Pages from the
# root, so anything committed here would be readable at azqato.com/brand/.
# The generator is ignored alongside it because it only builds that folder and
# would be a dangling reference in a fresh clone.
brand/
tools/build-brand-page.py
